The account of the parts as given by the file is now made out in full. That very large measure of the common store which the fourth of the like accounts calls for is in very fact to be found in the file itself. The question in that case resolves itself into one of whether so vast a region has been made ready for the use of it. The entry at 400110 will serve to begin the proceeding if the rest be right. The instructions which are to be had in the account which has been seen are full of the very errors which must of necessity put the proceeding to a stop. The shifting by a count from a register is not bound to the five bits it must use. The trials of greater and less will give the values tested in the stead of the one and the zero they are to give. The two results of the division are put the one in the place of the other. The loading and the putting in of the short and half values are made without the distinction in measure which they call for.

The very first of the accounts in which the whole of the matter of the region for the store is to be had has not yet come into view. That must be had before the matter of the putting in can proceed.

